# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# PRIVACY: fixtures are gitignored by default
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# All HTML fixtures are excluded from git unless explicitly allow-listed
# below. This protects WFP/Philips/presentation content from accidentally
# being committed to a public repo.
#
# To allow a sanitized fixture into git: add `!fixtures/your-file.html`
# below. Treat each addition as a deliberate decision — read the file
# first and confirm there are no real names, brand references, or
# internal content.
fixtures/*.html

# Allow-listed sanitized fixtures:
!fixtures/foreign-deck.html

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# PRIVACY: references folder (design mockups, brand assets)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Treated like fixtures — gitignored by default. Visual references
# may include placeholder content that resembles real WFP/Philips
# layouts, or be derived from internal product screens. Default to
# local-only. Allow-list individual files explicitly if a sanitized
# reference needs to ship.
references/

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# PRIVACY: any file with these names is gitignored everywhere
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Defense in depth — even if accidentally placed outside fixtures/
*-private.html
*-internal.html
*-confidential.*
.private-notes.md
